s assigned to a Power Plant, increases the productivity of the Factory Wild Mane is assigned to by +5%"}],"modules":[],"review":{"official":"\"Justice Knight\" is a\nRaythean\nExister-S1044 Model four-wheeled operation platform customized by a\nKazimierzian\nengineer, later remodeled and upgraded by\nMayer\nand\nClosure\n. Owing to its main searchlight function lacking use value, and its cover fire capacity being limited in its target market, its production has been halted. Before the\nRhodes Island\nEngineering Department got their hands on her, \"Justice Knight\" had already gone through a dozen modifications, big and small; her present capabilities are easily a far cry from the original model. Her old operating system and command memory data were damaged, unable to be recovered. After a swap for new core hardware and an expanded memory unit, an updated operating system plus additional artificial voice system, she is now hardly distinguishable from Raythean Industries's latest operation platforms. \"Justice Knight\" is a member of\nPinus Sylvestris Knightclub\n, and is currently authorized for use by Rhodes Island.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":30,"base":{"hp":396,"atk":137,"def":32,"res":0,"redeploy":200,"dp":3,"block":1,"interval":1},"max":{"hp":495,"atk":172,"def":41,"res":0,"redeploy":200,"dp":3,"block":1,"interval":1},"rangeId":"3-1"}],"trust":{"hp":100,"atk":45,"def":0}},"files":[{"section":"Performance Review","unlock":"Unlocked by default","description":"[Top Speed] 20km/h \n[Climb] Normal \n[Brake] Normal \n[Mobility] Normal \n[Endurance] Normal \n[Structural Integrity] Standard"},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Thanks to all manner of upgrades her original master, Wild Mane, has carried out on her, aside from her initial cover fire capacity, 'Justice Knight' has grown a list of everyday abilities, such as watering flowers, transporting takeout, recharging game consoles... For 'Justice Knight,' providing quick and convenient service is one of her callings. Her previous abandonment very much weighs on her, and ever since her retrieval and rebooting by Wild Mane, outside of recharging and maintenance hours, she'll actively hang around with others."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/one-star-icons/Justice%20Knight%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/one-star-skins/Justice%20Knight%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Tournament Fantasy Retrofit Kit","iconPath":"/one-star-icons/Justice%20Knight%20-%20Tournament%20Fantasy%20Retrofit%20Kit.webp","fullPath":"/one-star-skins/Justice%20Knight%20-%20Tournament%20Fantasy%20Retrofit%20Kit.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Sniper","type":"class","entries":[{"operatorName":"Archetto","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Archetto%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"Every 2.5 seconds when deployed, restores 1 Skill Point to all deployed Sniper allies that have an Offensive Recovery skill.","matchedKeyword":"Sniper"}]},{"operatorName":"Ch'en the Holungday","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Ch'en%20the%20Holungday%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"When deployed, Ch'en's ammo-based skills have a 22% (+2%) chance to not consume the corresponding ammo for each shot; Other Sniper Operators' ammo-based skills have a 10% chance instead (only the highest effect of this type will be applied)","matchedKeyword":"Sniper"}]},{"operatorName":"Schwarz","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Schwarz%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T3","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T3","sourceText":"When Schwarz and at least one more [Sniper] Operator are on the battlefield, all [S